rp><rt>まんぞく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>与<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えられていない<ruby>様子<rp>(</rp><rt>ようす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He was always filthy and looked like he wasn&#x27;t given enough food.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">証</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あかし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">证明；证据；迹象；证词；见证；（基督教）作见证；为信仰作证</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221001\">この<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>光<rp>(</rp><rt>ひかり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>についてあかしするために<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He came as a witness to testify concerning that light.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">赤字</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あかじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赤字；亏损；红字；红色文字；红笔批改；红笔批注</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111708\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はどうにか<ruby>赤字<rp>(</rp><rt>あかじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さずにすんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He managed to make both ends meet.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">明かす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あかす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">